      "system": {
        "notes": {
          "player": "",
          "gm": "<p>When the Inquisitorial Questkeeper suffers one or more Wounds, they lose the Frightened Condition if they have it. Frightened allies in Short Range who can see the Inquisitorial Questkeeper may immediately make a Discipline (Fear) Test with Advantage as a Free Action. Characters who succeed are no longer Frightened. Additionally, when the Inquisitorial Questkeeper is Defeated while engaged in melee, they may make one more Melee Attack action.  True Faith: The Inquisitorial Questkeeper has 1 point of Fate.</p>"
